const questions=[['What happens in the first call?','We discuss your business, current creative, offer, and goals. Then we explain whether our services fit and what a useful next step could look like.'],['Which platforms do you run ads on?','We focus on Facebook and Instagram advertising, alongside the creative and social content that support those campaigns.'],['What budget do I need?','There is no single budget for every business. We review your market, objective, and resources together. Ad spend and service fees are discussed separately before any work begins.'],['How quickly will I see results?','Timing depends on the offer, audience, budget, and sales process. We test and review performance rather than promising a fixed result or timeline.'],['How do I contact you?','Email runmoreadsteam@gmail.com, or contact Run More Ads through our linked Instagram and LinkedIn accounts.']];
await page('book-a-call','Book a Call','Start a conversation with Run More Ads about your creative and Meta advertising.',`<div class="contact-layout"><div class="contact-aside"><span class="eyebrow">Start here</span><h1>Your next campaign<br><em>starts here.</em></h1><p>Tell us about your business and what you want to grow. We’ll review your request and get in touch to arrange a strategy call.</p><div class="links"><a href="mailto:${email}">${email} ↗</a><a href="${instagram}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a><a href="${linkedin}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a><span class="muted">Azerbaijan · Founded in 2024 · 50+ brands</span></div></div><form class="contact-form" id="contact-form"><label class="field"><span class="sr-only">Name</span><input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100" placeholder="Name *"></label><label class="field"><span class="sr-only">Email</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="200" placeholder="Email *"></label><fieldset><legend>What services are you interested in?</legend><div class="choices">${['Content Creation','Social Management','Paid Media','All'].map((s,i)=>`<label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value="${s}" ${i===0?'checked':''} required><span>${s}</span></label>`).join('')}</div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Current monthly social media budget?</legend><div class="choices">${['Under $2K','$2K-$5K','$5K-$10K','$10K+'].map((s,i)=>`<label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="${s}" ${i===1?'checked':''} required><span>${s}</span></label>`).join('')}</div></fieldset><label class="field message-field"><span class="sr-only">Tell us about your business</span><textarea name="message" required maxlength="5000" placeholder="Tell us about your business... *"></textarea></label><div class="form-trap" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this empty<input name="website_confirm" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><button class="button submit-call" type="submit"><span>Book a call</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p class="form-note">By submitting, you agree to our <a href="/terms-of-service">terms &amp; conditions.</a><br><a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></p><p id="form-status" class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1" hidden></p></form></div><section class="faq"><span class="eyebrow">Questions</span><h2>Before we <em>talk.</em></h2>${questions.map(([q,a])=>`<details><summary>${esc(q)}</summary><p>${esc(a)}</p></details>`).join('')}</section>`,{withCta:false});

await page('privacy-policy','Privacy Policy','How Run More Ads handles website enquiries and contact information.',`<article class="article"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="muted">Updated 10 October 2026</p><p>Run More Ads is an advertising agency based in Azerbaijan. This page explains how information is handled when you use this website or contact us at <a href="mailto:${email}">${email}</a>.</p><h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>${crmReady?'When you submit the booking form, your name, email address, selected service, budget range, and business message are sent to our Base44 CRM. The CRM also records the submission time, request identifier, source, and country (Azerbaijan). The form does not send an email notification.':'The booking form is being connected to our CRM and is currently unavailable for submission. Form details are not sent or stored while the connection is unavailable. You can contact us using the links on the contact page.'}</p><h2>How we use enquiries</h2><p>We use the information you send to respond to your enquiry, discuss your requested services, and manage that conversation. Please avoid sending passwords, payment details, or sensitive personal information through the form or email.</p><h2>Hosting and external services</h2><p>The hosting provider may process technical information such as IP addresses and request logs to deliver and secure the website. Base44 processes and stores booking requests for our CRM. Only authorised agency users can review these requests. If you contact us directly by email, email services process that correspondence. Links to Instagram and LinkedIn take you to services with their own privacy policies.</p><h2>Cookies and storage</h2><p>We have not added advertising tracking pixels to this site. The form does not persist the text you enter in browser storage. Once a request is successfully submitted, its record is retained in our CRM to handle your enquiry. Hosting or authentication services may use information needed to deliver the site.</p><h2>Your information and choices</h2><p>You can ask us about information you have sent, request a correction, or request deletion by emailing ${email}. We retain correspondence only as needed to handle the enquiry, an ongoing business relationship, or applicable obligations. We do not sell enquiry information.</p><h2>Contact and updates</h2><p>For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:${email}">${email}</a>. This page may be updated when the website or our contact process changes.</p></article>`);
await page('terms-of-service','Terms of Service','Terms for using the Run More Ads website and contacting the agency.',`<article class="article"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Terms of Service</h1><p class="muted">Updated 10 October 2026</p><h2>Using this website</h2><p>This website introduces Run More Ads, an agency founded in Azerbaijan in 2024, and explains our creative and advertising approach. Please use the website and contact options lawfully, without interfering with their operation.</p><h2>Enquiries and services</h2><p>Submitting a booking request does not confirm an appointment, purchase a service, or create a campaign agreement. Our team contacts you to agree a meeting time. The scope, fees, advertising budget, timing, and responsibilities for any work are agreed separately in writing before work begins.</p><h2>Examples and performance</h2><p>Creative case studies on this website use the existing licensed stock footage to illustrate possible advertising approaches. They do not report the results of named client campaigns. Agency-wide figures describe the information supplied by Run More Ads and do not promise a result for another business. Advertising performance depends on the offer, market, creative, budget, and sales process.</p><h2>Website content</h2><p>The Run More Ads name, logo, and original site materials belong to their respective owners. Videos and other licensed media remain subject to the rights of their creators. Please contact us before reusing website content commercially.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>Instagram, LinkedIn, and email links connect to independent services. Their availability and their own terms apply when you use them.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about the website or a proposed service can be sent to <a href="mailto:${email}">${email}</a>. Our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> explains the enquiry process.</p></article>`);
